itle=\"Mike&#39;s Mines\">Mike's Mines</a>, containing <a href=\"/wiki/Candycorn\" title=\"Candycorn\">Candycorn</a>. As of 2024, the Halloween 2024 update brought back <b>Sweetstone</b>\n</p><p>It is no longer obtainable unless trading with another player or another Halloween event occurs, readding Sweetstone nodes.\n</p>\n<table class=\"navbox mw-collapsible\" style=\"background:#291F1D; width:100%; padding:.1em; margin:.5em auto; -webkit-border-radius:5px; -moz-border-radius:0 10px 10px 0\" data-expandtext=\"Open\" data-collapsetext=\"Close\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width:105px; background:#140401; -webkit-border-radius:5px; -moz-border-radius:0 10px 10px 0\"><span style=\"float:left; padding-left:10px; padding-top:4px; font-size:90%\"><a href=\"/wiki/Template:Stone_Nav\" title=\"Template:Stone Nav\"><span title=\"View this template\">v</span></a> • <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://oaklands.fandom.com/wiki/Template_talk:Stone_Nav\"><span title=\"Discuss this template\">d</span></a> • <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://oaklands.fandom.com/wiki/Template:Stone_Nav?action=edit\"><span title=\"Edit this template\">e</span></a></span><figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Oaklands\" title=\"Oaklands Wiki\"><img alt=\"Oaklands Wiki\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"115\" height=\"31\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Site-logo.png\" data-image-key=\"Site-logo.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/e/e6/Site-logo.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/115?cb=20221025233312\" /></a><figcaption>Oaklands Wiki</figcaption></figure>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding:0; margin:0\">\n<table class=\"navbox\" style=\"border-radius:5px 5px 0 0; font-size:95%; padding:0; text-align: